msgstr "Spraakherkenning is niet geïnstalleerd. Installeer het pakket %s."

#: src/dictate-engine.c
msgid "The speech model could not be loaded."
msgstr "Het spraakmodel kon niet worden geladen."

#: src/dictate-engine.c
msgid "Speech recognition could not be started."
msgstr "Spraakherkenning kon niet worden gestart."

#: src/dictate-engine.c
msgid "The microphone could not be opened."
msgstr "De microfoon kon niet worden geopend."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid ""
"Vibe, what time is it now? I'm teaching you how my voice sounds, so that you "
"only listen to me."
msgstr ""
"Vibe, hoe laat is het nu? Ik leer je hoe mijn stem klinkt, zodat je alleen "
"naar mij luistert."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid ""
"Read my new messages out loud, then tell me what is on my calendar for "
"tomorrow morning."
msgstr ""
"Lees mijn nieuwe berichten hardop voor en vertel me dan wat er morgenochtend "
"in mijn agenda staat."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid ""
"Call my sister on her mobile, and set an alarm for seven thirty tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"Bel mijn zus op haar mobiel en zet een wekker voor morgen om half acht."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "What's the time? Call Anna. Set a timer."
msgstr "Hoe laat is het? Bel Anna. Zet een timer."

#. TRANSLATORS: a phrase to read aloud, in quotation marks
#. TRANSLATORS: a thing to say to Vibe, in quotation marks
#: src/dictate-enroll.c src/dictate-onboarding.c
#, c-format
msgid "“%s”"
msgstr "“%s”"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Vibe says · repeat after me"
msgstr "Vibe zegt · zeg me na"

#. while Vibe says it, the microphone opens when it is done
#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Tap anywhere and read it again"
msgstr "Tik ergens en lees het nog eens voor"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Tap anywhere, then read the phrase"
msgstr "Tik ergens en lees dan de zin voor"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c src/dictate-onboarding.c src/dictate-stage.c
#: src/dictate-window.c
msgid "Vibe says"
msgstr "Vibe zegt"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "I can't listen right now."
msgstr "Ik kan nu niet luisteren."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Tap anywhere to go back"
msgstr "Tik ergens om terug te gaan"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c src/dictate-window.c
msgid "Listening"
msgstr "Luistert"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Go ahead…"
msgstr "Ga je gang…"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Say any command."
msgstr "Zeg een willekeurig commando."

#. TRANSLATORS: over the phrase being read: listening to phrase 2 of 4
#: src/dictate-enroll.c
#, c-format
msgid "Listening · phrase %u of %u"
msgstr "Luistert · zin %u van %u"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Read the phrase at your normal pace"
msgstr "Lees de zin in je normale tempo"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Tap anywhere, or just start talking"
msgstr "Tik ergens of begin gewoon te praten"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Voice Match is not ready yet."
msgstr "Stemherkenning is nog niet klaar."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Your recordings were not kept, and nothing changed on the phone."
msgstr "Je opnamen zijn niet bewaard en er is niets veranderd op de telefoon."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "I couldn't keep your voice sample."
msgstr "Ik kon je stemmonster niet bewaren."

# android: Framework sim_done_button (several translations, short)
#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Klaar"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "That's all I need."
msgstr "Dat is alles wat ik nodig heb."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Voice match is on. Say any command to test it. Nothing is carried out."
msgstr ""
"Stemherkenning staat aan. Zeg een willekeurig commando om het te testen. Er "
"wordt niets uitgevoerd."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Tap anywhere, then speak"
msgstr "Tik ergens en spreek dan"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c src/dictate-window.c
msgid "Tap anywhere to try again"
msgstr "Tik ergens om het opnieuw te proberen"

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "Say a bit more."
msgstr "Zeg wat meer."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "That was too short to tell whose voice it is."
msgstr "Dat was te kort om te horen van wie de stem is."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "I couldn't check that."
msgstr "Dat kon ik niet controleren."

#. TRANSLATORS: a voice check's result: 88% match, 75% needed
#: src/dictate-enroll.c
#, c-format
msgid "%.0f%% match, %.0f%% needed. Vibe would carry out the command."
msgstr "%.0f%% overeenkomst, %.0f%% nodig. Vibe zou het commando uitvoeren."

#: src/dictate-enroll.c
msgid "That's you."
